      "openalex_id": "W1998228075",
      "doi": "10.3390/h4010149",
      "title": "In Search of Lost Community: The Literary Image between \u201cProust\u201d and \u201cBaudelaire\u201d in Walter Benjamin\u2019s Modernization Lament",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Karyn Ball",
